WEBVTT

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:04.980
<b>Nanbaka</b>

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:19.360
New recruits! As of today,
you are all Nanba Prison guards.

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:23.430
Be proud, and apply yourselves to your work!

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:25.300
Yes, ma'am!

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.100
You are to report to your assigned buildings.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.260
Make sure you follow your supervisor's orders.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:34.270
Yes, ma'am!

00:00:55.320 --> 00:01:00.490
<b>Nanbaka</b>

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:10.020
<b>Super Hitoshi-kun</b>

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:10.020
Hey!

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:16.920
Damn you, Number 15!

00:02:16.920 --> 00:02:18.900
You got out of your cell again?!

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:22.000
Yo, Hajime. You're quick, as usual.

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:24.910
What, you trying for a 
new record or something?

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:26.450
Why would I?

00:02:26.860 --> 00:02:30.420
You're just wandering around 
aimlessly again, aren't you?

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:33.710
You never know what you'll 
find until you go out, right?

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:36.340
My point is, don't break out of your cell!

00:02:36.590 --> 00:02:40.050
Here we go again. 
Another of Hajime's lectures...

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:41.500
I can't hear you!

00:02:41.500 --> 00:02:43.340
Don't run away, damn you!

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:46.850
I won't go easy on you today.

00:02:46.850 --> 00:02:49.350
You're always increasing my workload.

00:02:53.230 --> 00:02:55.740
Come at me if you can.

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:57.960
This thing is hard as a rock, you know.

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:00.740
<b>Whack</b>

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:04.270
You couldn't beat me with those 
blades in a thousand years.

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:06.020
You still haven't learned, have you?

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:07.170
Sorry.

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:13.970
Ow! Stop that! Let go!

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:15.160
Shut up!

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:18.260
Escape again and I'll put you in 
solitary confinement! Got me?!

00:03:18.260 --> 00:03:20.940
Welcome back, Jyugo. You're early!

00:03:20.940 --> 00:03:23.110
You want to have dinner? Or a bath?

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:25.760
Or... me?

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:27.140
Shut up!

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:34.100
Yoohoo, Hajime!

00:03:34.100 --> 00:03:35.120
Mitsuru...

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:36.770
Yep, it's just little old me!

00:03:37.090 --> 00:03:38.370
You need something?

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:39.940
Yeah, yeah, I do.

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:47.310
It's about the new guard coming 
to Building 13 today for training.

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:48.290
Huh?!

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:50.600
Seriously? No one told me that!

00:03:50.600 --> 00:03:52.790
I didn't hear anything 
about that in the meeting!

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:55.280
Because I didn't mention it.

00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:59.590
It's just a little surprise from me.

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:01.300
Screw you!

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:04.060
What, what? A new guard is coming?

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:06.800
But it'll be a guy, right? Lame.

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.360
You punks stay out of this!

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:09.600
That's right!

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:13.220
I brought a very lively rookie here for you.

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:15.650
Now, you all play nice!

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:17.650
Yes, sir!

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:20.150
You shut up, too! Don't get all chummy!

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:22.580
And? Who is this rookie?

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:26.160
I wanna see him now!

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:29.030
I think he'll be here soon.

00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:32.330
Why did you need to keep it
a secret from me, anyway?

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:35.360
Jeez... I didn't sign up to babysit a rookie.

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:37.540
Oh, there he is!

00:04:46.290 --> 00:04:49.310
Hi, Big Brother! Yoohoo!

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:54.420
That's... Hajime's...

00:04:54.420 --> 00:04:55.810
But if I recall correctly...

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:59.460
His little brother!

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:03.820
Hito-chan, this is Building 13,
where your brother works.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:07.320
Mitsuru-san, thank you very 
much for bringing me here.

00:05:09.320 --> 00:05:12.860
I was assigned to be Building 13's
new guard from now on.

00:05:12.860 --> 00:05:14.610
I'm Hitoshi Sugoroku.

00:05:14.610 --> 00:05:16.580
Nice to meet you all!

00:05:16.750 --> 00:05:18.110
Likewise!

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:21.090
I was expecting a new character to show up.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:23.540
Please, go home, Hitoshi.

00:05:23.540 --> 00:05:27.090
Oh, Big Brother. That joke isn't even funny.

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:29.090
I'm actually being serious.

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:34.100
Hey...

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:37.120
Do you really think Hitoshi 
is Hajime's brother?

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:38.520
What's with you now?

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:41.820
Actually, that's been bothering me, too.

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:43.440
You, too?

00:05:43.440 --> 00:05:45.750
Think about it. Hajime? The gorilla?

00:05:45.750 --> 00:05:47.490
There's just no way!

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:50.040
Even his skeletal structure 
is just like a gorilla's.

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:53.390
There's no way someone like that is 
a blood relative of that cutie.

00:05:53.390 --> 00:05:54.080
It's unforgivable.

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:56.330
But he is a guy, right?

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:58.210
Shut up!

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:04.120
So this is where you work. Building 13...

00:06:04.120 --> 00:06:05.740
This is my first time coming here.

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:08.320
To think you became a prison guard...

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:09.720
I'm shocked.

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:14.100
I knew you were studying 
something behind my back.

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:16.380
Why didn't you tell me?

00:06:16.380 --> 00:06:19.100
Because if I had, you wouldn't have let me do it.

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:20.920
You're damn right.

00:06:22.120 --> 00:06:24.610
This is gonna give me even more stress...

00:06:24.610 --> 00:06:25.890
Now, now, Supervisor.

00:06:25.890 --> 00:06:27.970
He's a fine Nanba correctional officer now.

00:06:27.970 --> 00:06:30.450
Let's welcome him with open arms.

00:06:31.530 --> 00:06:35.340
Yeah! I'm happy Hito-chan 
became a guard here.

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:37.010
Right? Wait, huh?

00:06:37.010 --> 00:06:38.640
I just got back from my exam.

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:44.420
Have some tea to calm yourself down.

00:06:44.420 --> 00:06:45.430
That's hot!

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:48.300
Damn it, Yamato! Can't you 
put the tea down gently?!

00:06:48.300 --> 00:06:52.020
Yes! Sorry! I just can't 
help getting all fired up!

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:54.870
You don't need to get fired up for tea!

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:57.140
Also, you cracked my tea cup again!

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:58.280
Now, now, Supervisor.

00:06:58.280 --> 00:07:00.310
I'll go pour some fresh tea for you.

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:02.500
<i>There's a nice atmosphere here.</i>

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:04.310
<i>Big Brother seems to enjoy it.</i>

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:08.820
Are you really Hajime's brother?

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:10.290
You surprised me!

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:11.630
It's just you, Number 15-kun.

00:07:11.630 --> 00:07:12.820
You're too surprised.

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:15.070
It's Number 15-kun!

00:07:15.070 --> 00:07:16.610
You're looking well again today!

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:17.650
Yo, Yamato.

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:20.710
Well, why don't you have some tea?

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:22.080
That's hot!

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:24.860
Number 15, you got out again?!

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:26.550
I'll throw your ass in solitary now!

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:28.770
Hey, hey, it wasn't my idea.

00:07:28.770 --> 00:07:30.150
I'm just a chaperone!

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:32.590
That's still jailbreaking!

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:36.100
<i>Amazing! He really can escape easily.</i>

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:38.050
It was my idea.

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:40.440
And I tagged along.

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:43.860
You guys are here, too?! 
Stop eating the rice crackers!

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:47.360
They said they wanted to confirm 
something about Hitoshi.

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.770
Confirm what?

00:07:49.770 --> 00:07:52.610
If he really is your brother.

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:56.370
Huh? What do you mean by that?

00:07:56.580 --> 00:08:00.360
Because a vicious gorilla and 
a rabbit look nothing alike.

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:02.870
I just want to know the truth.

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:04.880
You're gonna regret that later.

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:07.050
Big Brother is not a vicious gorilla!

00:08:07.050 --> 00:08:08.380
He's a kind gorilla!

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:10.700
You're not helping!

00:08:10.700 --> 00:08:12.880
Forget that, let's capture them right now!

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:14.380
Give me a hand, Yamato!

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:15.440
Understood!

00:08:15.440 --> 00:08:16.390
Oh, crap!

00:08:16.390 --> 00:08:18.620
Me too, me too! I'll help, too!

00:08:18.620 --> 00:08:19.390
Huh?

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:22.420
Wanna do that again?

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:23.920
Shall we?

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:27.660
All right, Hajime! Let's have a match!

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:29.400
If you're able to catch us,

00:08:29.400 --> 00:08:31.780
we'll accept that Hitoshi is your brother.

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:33.390
Who the hell do you think you are?!

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:36.940
I will never believe someone 
that cute is Hajime's brother!

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:38.280
Moron, moron!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.610
You're all pumped up today.

00:08:40.610 --> 00:08:42.010
You're that frustrated?

00:08:42.010 --> 00:08:44.270
Shut up! I'm not frustrated!

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:46.280
Okay, let's get this started!

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:49.290
Cell 13's traditional game of tag!

00:08:49.290 --> 00:08:51.300
<b>Cell 13's Traditional Game of Tag</b>

00:08:52.270 --> 00:08:54.450
You punks are pissing me 
off to no end today!

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:55.930
Okay! I'll do my best!

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:57.800
No, wait, Hitoshi!

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.810
Stop!

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:04.810
Stop, you punks!

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:08.180
The supervisor is as energetic as ever.

00:09:08.180 --> 00:09:10.260
We should go after them, as well!

00:09:10.260 --> 00:09:13.070
Whatever. Just don't get lost.

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:15.540
Number 15-kun got caught easily,

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:18.070
but you didn't go with them, 
huh, Number 25-kun?

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:22.580
Doctor Okina said not to exercise too
much after taking my medicine.

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:24.410
What do you really think?

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:25.920
Huh? About what?

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:28.100
About Hitoshi.

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:33.880
Well... I thought he'd be athletic 
if he was Hajime's brother.

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:36.830
But isn't he slower than Jyugo?

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:37.470
Stop!

00:09:37.470 --> 00:09:39.130
He is devastatingly slow.

00:09:39.130 --> 00:09:40.840
Yeah, he can't be Hajime's brother!

00:09:40.840 --> 00:09:43.540
It bugs you that much to admit 
he's Hajime's brother?

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.230
Of course it does!

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:48.670
He has a gorilla face,
but he's very athletic, smart,

00:09:48.670 --> 00:09:51.390
and I hate to say it, but he's 
a better gambler than me!

00:09:51.390 --> 00:09:53.470
Also, he has a gorilla face,
but he's very tall,

00:09:53.470 --> 00:09:57.060
he's a supervising officer, competent, 
very accomplished, and has no weaknesses.

00:09:57.060 --> 00:09:59.330
That alone pisses me off,

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:04.570
but that gorilla face has a super stylish, 
cute, lolita-looking brother, too?!

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:06.570
How much is he gonna pile on his plate?!

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:10.880
Stupid gorilla-faced Hajime!
Man, it pisses me off!

00:10:11.180 --> 00:10:13.260
<i>He still thinks his own face looks better...</i>

00:10:15.770 --> 00:10:18.640
Aw, I can't keep up at all.

00:10:18.640 --> 00:10:21.760
A guard's job is tough.

00:10:21.960 --> 00:10:24.770
I told you, this job isn't for you.

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:28.770
Big Brother, are you always 
chasing after inmates like this?

00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:30.940
I hate to admit it, but yeah.

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:33.770
I'll go get them now. You go back.

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:36.280
No! I wanna help!

00:10:36.280 --> 00:10:39.260
You've always been clumsy and slow.

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:40.990
You'll just be in my way, so don't.

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:43.660
How cruel! You're so mean, Big Brother!

00:10:44.050 --> 00:10:45.660
Turn right here.

00:10:45.660 --> 00:10:46.980
Understood!

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:51.040
I said right! This is why you 
always get lost, you idiot!

00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:53.560
Sorry!

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:55.730
I don't see Hajime or Hitoshi coming after us.

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:58.480
It's been a while, so maybe he got confused.

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:00.150
Now's my chance.

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:02.050
Hey, what are you doing?

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:06.060
Adding a small option to liven up the game.

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:08.060
I found you, you punks!

00:11:08.510 --> 00:11:10.060
Shit! He found us!

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:12.560
You two better prepare yourselves.

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:15.570
H-Hey! Uno, what are you doing?!
We gotta run!

00:11:15.570 --> 00:11:18.930
There it is. This wall has 
a different color, see?

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:21.450
I saw this once when I broke out with Jyugo.

00:11:21.450 --> 00:11:22.950
Idiot! Don't push that!

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:24.120
That reaction...

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:26.270
Is it a switch to trigger a trap?

00:11:26.270 --> 00:11:28.380
Here I go. Push the button.

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:36.610
All right! Success!

00:11:36.610 --> 00:11:39.590
Huh? It was sleeping gas for me.

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:41.340
It's something weaker now?

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:47.400
Huh? What's this?

00:11:47.400 --> 00:11:48.600
Is this...

00:11:48.600 --> 00:11:50.250
Liquid nitrogen?!

00:11:50.730 --> 00:11:53.540
Wait, is this prison trying
to kill the inmates?!

00:11:53.540 --> 00:11:55.090
How should I know?

00:11:55.090 --> 00:11:57.010
When did they add this upgrade?

00:11:57.010 --> 00:11:59.320
Let's just run and pretend nothing happened.

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:00.740
Y-Yeah...

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:02.090
You punks...

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:05.740
Triggering the latest trap just for a laugh...

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:08.210
Did I just hear his inner thoughts?!

00:12:08.210 --> 00:12:10.250
Also, he's still alive?!

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:14.920
I'm the one who has to clean up 
the mess and report all this.

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:20.010
There's not a single decent human 
being in here! It pisses me off!

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:22.010
Don't mess with me!

00:12:23.240 --> 00:12:26.210
I hope you punks are prepared.

00:12:26.210 --> 00:12:27.760
Especially you, Number 11!

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:29.300
Oh, shit!

00:12:32.890 --> 00:12:34.900
Something flew at us?!

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:36.320
What did he...

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:41.900
I missed.

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:44.150
You're throwing your brother at us?!

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:46.440
Hey, are you okay?

00:12:55.420 --> 00:12:57.400
Big Brother, I've told you before!

00:12:57.400 --> 00:13:01.200
Don't throw me at other people!

00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:03.540
It's faster than running.

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:06.400
Your body was always tough, 
so I'm sure you can handle it.

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:07.930
You're so mean!

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:10.840
So, Number 11, Number 69...

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:14.220
I won't miss this time. You can count on that!

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:17.440
Big Brother, I hate it when 
you hold me like this!

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:19.940
U-Uno, to tell you the truth,

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:22.880
I believe Hitoshi is Hajime's brother now.

00:13:24.460 --> 00:13:25.840
Hey, Yamato.

00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:28.750
Why are we in Tower B?!

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:31.830
I told you they were in Tower A, to the east!

00:13:32.380 --> 00:13:35.900
How odd. I'm sure I was heading east.

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:37.790
This is west, idiot!

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:40.750
Isn't east toward the hand 
you hold chopsticks with?

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:49.010
<b>Nanbaka</b>

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:54.020
<b>Nanbaka</b>

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:01.440
<b>Warning
Trap Activated</b>

00:13:58.680 --> 00:14:00.080
Building 13?

00:14:00.080 --> 00:14:01.440
Oh, my.

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:04.940
Did someone escape?

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:06.950
<b>Emergency</b>

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:09.320
<b>All Normal</b>

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:13.330
Jeez... I can see everything 
from here, you know.

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:17.330
Chief! The alarm went off in Building 13!

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:20.140
Oh, that was a false alarm.

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:22.340
They said they were gonna test it today.

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:25.610
I... I see. I apologize, sir.

00:14:25.610 --> 00:14:30.840
You'd better do your job, Hajime-chan.

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:40.040
Hey! Do something!

00:14:40.040 --> 00:14:41.510
I'm thinking!

00:14:41.510 --> 00:14:43.290
I know there's a switch around here...

00:14:43.290 --> 00:14:45.280
Oh, there it is!

00:14:52.530 --> 00:14:53.780
All right!

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:13.050
Help...

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:17.220
Stop, damn you!

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:24.170
Finally found them.

00:15:25.060 --> 00:15:27.490
What the hell are you guys—

00:15:29.040 --> 00:15:29.840
What?

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:33.080
Oh, that's the supervisor!

00:15:33.340 --> 00:15:34.570
What is he—

00:15:34.570 --> 00:15:37.080
Outta my way!

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:41.280
What the hell?

00:15:41.280 --> 00:15:44.030
I have no idea.

00:15:44.580 --> 00:15:48.620
Damn it! Hajime thinks he can 
just smack us like that?

00:15:48.620 --> 00:15:50.110
I'll kill him—

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:51.130
Wait!

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:54.100
What the hell?!

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:55.780
Sorry, Number 15-kun,

00:15:56.340 --> 00:16:00.600
but if I lose you, I'll get lost.

00:16:00.600 --> 00:16:02.980
You get lost even when I am with you!

00:16:03.620 --> 00:16:05.440
Where the hell did they go?!

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:08.750
Big Brother, I'm dizzy.

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:10.660
You two are as close as ever, I see.

00:16:10.660 --> 00:16:12.490
Well, you are brothers, after all.

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:15.450
Mitsuru...

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:18.760
Yoohoo! It's me again.

00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:21.050
When did you get here?!

00:16:21.050 --> 00:16:22.250
Did you see something?!

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:24.210
I just got here.

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:26.250
What? Did something happen?

00:16:26.550 --> 00:16:27.810
It's nothing.

00:16:27.810 --> 00:16:30.010
Anyway, what do you want? 
Is it another rookie?

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:34.360
Nope. I'm here for a pick-up. A pick-up!

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:35.760
To pick up who?

00:16:35.950 --> 00:16:37.500
Hito-chan.

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:42.300
What does he mean, Hitoshi?

00:16:42.300 --> 00:16:47.650
Well, to be honest, Mitsuru-san 
assigned me here as a favor.

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:53.150
I really wanted to see you in action up close.

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:56.800
I wanted to see if I could be any help.

00:16:56.800 --> 00:16:59.970
So I begged him to assign 
me here just for one day.

00:16:59.970 --> 00:17:02.580
I haven't even told the warden yet.

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:03.790
Hey, now...

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:08.230
But you know, even though it was only 
for a short time, I really had fun.

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:11.670
I'm so happy I got to work 
alongside you, Big Brother!

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:17.660
Everyone here is so interesting, kind, and fun.

00:17:17.660 --> 00:17:21.930
I had no idea your work was this much fun.

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:25.060
I like this prison even more now.

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:27.060
Is that so?

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:31.650
Well, then. I'm gonna take Hito-chan to 
the building he's actually assigned to.

00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:33.280
I'll come again, Big Brother!

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:34.240
No, don't.

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:35.580
So mean...

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:38.070
You're so mean, Hajime!

00:17:38.070 --> 00:17:39.450
Seriously, don't come back!

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:42.740
Nothing got resolved. It leaves 
a bad taste in my mouth!

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:47.170
After all that, he left before we could verify 
whether he's really Hajime's brother.

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:50.340
But we can't just walk out there now.

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:52.420
Actually, if he wasn't Hajime's brother,

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:55.840
he wouldn't have said all that stuff.

00:17:55.840 --> 00:17:59.090
When you get down to it, 
maybe we were being rude.

00:18:07.350 --> 00:18:09.190
See ya, Hajime!

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:11.080
Bye-bye, Big Brother!

00:18:11.080 --> 00:18:13.000
Hey, Rock...

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:16.260
I think I'm gonna start doubting 
that he's a guy first.

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:17.920
Yeah, me too.

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:19.360
<b>Whack</b>

00:18:18.720 --> 00:18:19.360
<b>Whack</b>

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:21.200
Stop creating more work for me!

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:23.560
We're sorry.

00:18:24.240 --> 00:18:26.410
We're finally back!

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.500
Welcome back!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.630
Hey, Seitarou.

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:31.950
It might not work,

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:35.000
but you should have this guy 
carry around a GPS navigator.

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:36.080
Huh?

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:38.700
I've been assigned to 
work here starting today.

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:40.080
I'm Hitoshi Sugoroku.

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:41.580
Nice to meet you!

00:18:42.460 --> 00:18:43.940
<i>No one told me about this.</i>

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:50.520
H-Hey, there... Young lady!

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:54.020
<b>He's not a "young lady,"
so he thinks they're
talking to someone else</b>

00:18:50.780 --> 00:18:52.070
Young lady!

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:53.230
Miss!

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:55.450
Wait a minute.

00:18:55.450 --> 00:18:57.030
M-My stomach hurts!

00:18:57.670 --> 00:18:58.530
Sorry?

00:18:59.030 --> 00:19:01.280
I'm sorry for shouting at you so suddenly.

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:05.030
You're just so beautiful, I couldn't help myself.

00:19:05.030 --> 00:19:06.810
Is your stomach okay?

00:19:06.810 --> 00:19:07.810
It's all better.

00:19:07.810 --> 00:19:09.810
But what are you doing in a place like this?

00:19:09.810 --> 00:19:13.540
I'm here to deliver some data 
to the Building 3 supervisor.

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:18.340
I feel very fortunate to have someone 
as beautiful and lovely as you come visit.

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:19.940
Thank you.

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:22.800
By the way, may I ask you one question?

00:19:22.800 --> 00:19:24.540
Yes, go ahead.

00:19:25.550 --> 00:19:28.560
Can you please tell me what color 
panties you're wearing today?

00:19:28.560 --> 00:19:30.560
I'm wearing pink panties today.

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:32.040
Pink like a peach...

00:19:32.040 --> 00:19:35.410
Such a refined and lovely color 
is perfect for someone like you.

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:36.890
How splendid.

00:19:36.890 --> 00:19:39.820
Then may I ask a question this time?

00:19:40.120 --> 00:19:41.820
Yes, please.

00:19:42.060 --> 00:19:44.480
What color bra are you wearing today?

00:19:44.820 --> 00:19:46.830
I'm not wearing a bra.

00:19:58.170 --> 00:20:01.090
Supervisor, I've delivered 
the documents to Building 3.

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:03.090
Good. Thank you.

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:05.600
Oh, you're having lunch?

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:07.160
Have some red bean soup.

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:09.760
Thanks.

00:20:09.760 --> 00:20:12.380
What's up, little dog? 
Something on your mind?

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:15.360
I guess you could say that.

00:20:15.360 --> 00:20:19.470
Kenshirou-san can't come up with an 
excuse to not go to the party today.

00:20:19.470 --> 00:20:22.030
It's at Building 4's living quarters.

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:23.360
I'm going, too.

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:25.560
Sounds fun. What's the problem?

00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:27.260
Can't hold your liquor, little dog?

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:29.720
No, it's not that.

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:31.940
I just don't like drinking with them.

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:33.870
You're brutally honest, aren't you?

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:37.380
Speaking of which, Number 634-kun, 
you're from Germany, right?

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:38.240
Huh?

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:41.840
Germans love beer, right?

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:43.590
People from Germany must say,

00:20:43.590 --> 00:20:46.550
"I'll start with a beer!" too.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:48.140
Big Brother thinks so, too.

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:52.020
Beer to start? More like beer 'til the end.

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:55.400
<i>Th-This must be the German spirit!</i>

00:20:57.400 --> 00:21:01.140
Why is that little puppy only drinking sake?

00:21:01.140 --> 00:21:03.270
He said his Japanese spirit was burning.

00:21:03.270 --> 00:21:06.070
Oh?! That's magnificent, Kenshirou-dono!

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:07.410
I'll join you!

00:21:08.290 --> 00:21:10.080
No, you won't!

00:21:10.690 --> 00:21:12.680
There were other traps here, right?

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:14.800
Huh? I don't remember.

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:19.170
I wanna cut Hajime down to size this time!

00:21:19.560 --> 00:21:22.320
<i>A typical day in Nanba Prison.</i>

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:26.600
<i>But the real horror was drawing near...</i>

00:21:34.930 --> 00:21:38.420
<i>Just kidding. Gotcha!</i>

00:21:38.420 --> 00:21:40.990
<i>I got you twice in a row!</i>

00:21:41.890 --> 00:21:44.480
<i>Huh? No way. Really?</i>

00:21:44.480 --> 00:21:45.950
<i>This is supposed to be a comedy anime.</i>

00:21:45.950 --> 00:21:48.580
<i>This type of development isn't good 
for someone in my position, you know.</i>

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:50.950
<i>You're just gonna black out 
as I say, "Yeah!" right?</i>

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:25.870 --> 00:23:27.280
Nanba Prison...

00:23:27.280 --> 00:23:30.550
They say Hell can be found 
deep beneath Building 5.

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:33.980
It's called Gogyousan Underground Cell.

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:37.530
And that cauldron of Hell is about to open.

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:40.020
<b>The Traitorous Building 5</b>

00:23:37.530 --> 00:23:40.020
Next episode: "The Traitorous Building 5."
